    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to bring this 3 bedroom, 3 bath terraced property to the market in the ever-popular The Paddocks Walk development, Adamstown. The popular development is located close to Lucan Village with every imaginable amenity on your doorstep the location is truly next to none. Within a stone's throw you will find local bars, shops, schools, along with a host of bus routes, the N4 & M50 road networks. With internal living accommodation of c. 81 Sqm, in brief this property consists of; Entrance hall, wc, living room and open plan kitchen/diner to the ground floor. upstairs you will find three bedrooms with master benefitting from ensuite and also the family bathroom. Externally you will find a fully enclosed, larger than average WEST facing garden whilst the front offers a driveway for off road parking. No. 4 comes to the market in need of some cosmetic updating throughout but provides an ideal opportunity for its next occupants to purchase a well located property and make it their own. Based on recent success in this area we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest and book a viewing.\n\nKey Features\n\nBER C1\nc. 81 Sqm\nThree bedrooms\nThree bath\nNo onward chain\nTerraced property\nGas central heating\nSought after development\nClose to shops, schools and major road networks\nViewing is highly advised!\n\nDirections\nFrom Lucan, Co. Dublin, join the R136 Outer Ring Road toward Adamstown. Take the exit for Adamstown, follow Adamstown Avenue, then turn into The Paddocks estate. Continue inside the estate to reach 4 The Paddocks Walk"
      },
      {
